  <item>
    <title>Vol.34 失败固然可怕，朋友的成功更加令人揪心！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c20a1d521e5c0a80b8efac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c20a1d521e5c0a80b8efac</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Mar 2026 03:54:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小8有一个小小的疑问：朋友之间要相处到什么程度才会不嫉妒和羡慕对方比自己厉害的地方呢？ &nbsp;刚好楼西在跟89一起吃饭，三个人一起进行了激烈的讨论！</span></p><span></span><p><span>先说结论“失败固然可怕，朋友的成功更加令人揪心！”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【听友群】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>添加微信小助手：</span><strong><span>Recentlyindoing8</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>发送</span><strong><span>“最近在干嘛”</span></strong><span>，拉你进听友群！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容摘要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">2:31</a> </span></strong><span>89：努力不会被嫉妒，被嫉妒的或许是“站在风口的猪”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">3:42</a> 小8最好的朋友考研上岸之后，小8在家独自准备考试，所以“听到对方说什么都会觉得在炫耀”的心情会慢慢产生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">5:13</a> 要分清是“羡慕”还是“嫉妒”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">6:33</a> 嫉妒是处在同一个领域才会产生的心情吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">9:55</a> 楼西和美女搭档参加原创音乐比赛，因为外貌被选角导演“拉下船”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 小8人生中第一次“不劳而获”？或许并不是没付出努力！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 是否家境不同的每个人，也是另一种平等？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2044">34:04</a> 对于前任的态度</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期歌单】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>他 - 寓言租赁部</span></p><span></span><p><span>麒麟 - 早安</span></p><span></span><p><span>念念不忘 - 张震岳</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听方式】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Apple Podcasts / 小宇宙 / QQ音乐 / 网易云音乐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【商务合作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：oo91999@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【社交媒体】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：@最近在干嘛 @89 @在舟樾</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云：@88889</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@在舟樾</span></p>]]></description>
